  "description": "Site-wide SEO & content audit for Umbraco (16, 17, 18). Crawls every Content & Media URL (plus sitemap.xml), checks for broken links/images/resources, and audits each page for SEO, Open Graph/Twitter, technical SEO, content quality, a static accessibility subset and carbon emissions — with a composite SEO score, a run health score, grouped issues with priority, orphaned/duplicate detection, incremental scans and CSV export, all in a dedicated backoffice section. Runs as a recurring background job (auto-discovered by uTPro Job Monitor). Built on the framework-agnostic T4VN.Seo.Core engine.",
